{
  "id": "E144",
  "title": "Air Conditioning Disease",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-08-24",
  "synopsis": "It’s comfortable to stay indoors with the air conditioner on. However, it might make you sick…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/506/b79128aea89e155ef9f14cab3056af074b6769fa.mp3?1503339889",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "空调病\n\n李力：安妮，你的房间怎么这么冷？\n安妮：今天室外温度已经超过了三十七度。所以我一回房间就开了空调。\n李力：你的脸色很不好，哪里不舒服吗？\n安妮：我不知道怎么了，现在头疼得厉害。\n李力：这很可能是“空调病”。\n安妮：“空调病”？是空调让我生病了吗？\n李力：很可能是。你的房间一直关着门，空气不能流通，而且房间里的温度太低，你又穿得太少。\n安妮：那该怎么办？我不想生病啊。\n李力：关掉空调吧。现在室外凉快一些了，也起风了，我帮你把窗户打开。\n安妮：好的，谢谢你。",
    "traditional": "空調病\n\n李力：安妮，你的房間怎麼這麼冷？\n安妮：今天室外溫度已經超過了三十七度。所以我一回房間就開了空調。\n李力：你的臉色很不好，哪裏不舒服嗎？\n安妮：我不知道怎麼了，現在頭疼得厲害。\n李力：這很可能是“空調病”。\n安妮：“空調病”？是空調讓我生病了嗎？\n李力：很可能是。你的房間一直關著門，空氣不能流通，而且房間裡的溫度太低，你又穿得太少。\n安妮：那該怎麼辦？我不想生病啊。\n李力：關掉空調吧。現在室外涼快一些了，也起風了，我幫你把窗戶打開。\n安妮：好的，謝謝你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Air Conditioning Disease"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "李力：安妮，你的房间怎么这么冷？",
      "traditional": "李力：安妮，你的房間怎麼這麼冷？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì ān nī nǐ de fáng jiān zěn me zhè me lěng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Annie, why is your room so cold?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：今天室外温度已经超过了三十七度。",
      "traditional": "安妮：今天室外溫度已經超過了三十七度。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī jīn tiān shì wài wēn dù yǐ jīng chāo guò le sān shí qī dù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "所以我一回房间就开了空调。",
      "traditional": "所以我一回房間就開了空調。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ wǒ yì huí fáng jiān jiù kāi le kōng tiáo",
      "english": "Annie: The temperature outside is more than 37 degrees today."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So I turned on the air conditioner as soon as I got back to my room."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "李力：你的脸色很不好，哪里不舒服吗？",
      "traditional": "李力：你的臉色很不好，哪裏不舒服嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì nǐ de liǎn sè hěn bù hǎo nǎ lǐ bù shū fu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: You look pale, are you feeling alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "安妮：我不知道怎么了，现在头疼得厉害。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我不知道怎麼了，現在頭疼得厲害。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ bù zhī dào zěn me le xiàn zài tóu téng de lì hai",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I don't know what it is. Right now I have a bad headache."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "李力：这很可能是“空调病”。",
      "traditional": "李力：這很可能是“空調病”。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì zhè hěn kě néng shì kōng tiáo bìng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: It's probably air conditioning disease."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "安妮：“空调病”？是空调让我生病了吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：“空調病”？是空調讓我生病了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī kōng tiáo bìng shì kōng tiáo ràng wǒ shēng bìng le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Air conditioning disease? Is it the air conditioner making me sick?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "李力：很可能是。你的房间一直关着门，空气不能流通，",
      "traditional": "李力：很可能是。你的房間一直關著門，空氣不能流通，",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì hěn kě néng shì nǐ de fáng jiān yì zhí guān zhe mén kōng qì bù néng liú tōng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "而且房间里的温度太低，你又穿得太少。",
      "traditional": "而且房間裡的溫度太低，你又穿得太少。",
      "pinyin": "ér qiě fáng jiān lǐ de wēn dù tài dī nǐ yòu chuān de tài shǎo",
      "english": "Li Li: Most likely. Your room is always closed, no fresh air will circulate into the room."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The temperature in your room is also too low, and you wear too little."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "安妮：那该怎么办？我不想生病啊。",
      "traditional": "安妮：那該怎麼辦？我不想生病啊。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī nà gāi zěn me bàn wǒ bù xiǎng shēng bìng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What should I do? I don't want to get sick."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "李力：关掉空调吧。现在室外凉快一些了，也起风了，我帮你把窗户打开。",
      "traditional": "李力：關掉空調吧。現在室外涼快一些了，也起風了，我幫你把窗戶打開。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì guān diào kōng tiáo ba xiàn zài shì wài liáng kuai yì xiē le yě qǐ fēng le wǒ bāng nǐ bǎ chuāng hu dǎ kāi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Turn off your air conditioner. It is cool outside and the wind is rising now. I'll open the window for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "安妮：好的，谢谢你。",
      "traditional": "安妮：好的，謝謝你。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hǎo de xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Ok. Thank you."
    }
  ],
