      "Air Conditioning Disease",
      "",
      "Li Li: Annie, why is your room so cold?",
      "",
      "Annie: The temperature outside is more than 37 degrees today.",
      "So I turned on the air conditioner as soon as I got back to my room.",
      "",
      "Li Li: You look pale, are you feeling alright?",
      "",
      "Annie: I don't know what it is. Right now I have a bad headache.",
      "",
      "Li Li: It's probably air conditioning disease.",
      "",
      "Annie: Air conditioning disease? Is it the air conditioner making me sick?",
      "",
      "Li Li: Most likely. Your room is always closed, no fresh air will circulate into the room.",
      "The temperature in your room is also too low, and you wear too little.",
      "",
      "Annie: What should I do? I don't want to get sick.",
      "",
      "Li Li: Turn off your air conditioner. It is cool outside and the wind is rising now. I'll open the window for you.",
      "",
      "Annie: Ok. Thank you.",
      ""
